  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Specific instances of a world should have a different screen in the menu(s) than the world itself. The world page should show less info about the public instance selected for quick-join, but other than that, that page could remain the same (or be more like the new avatar page, with more details, images, and attribution about the world). The instance page would show instance-specific info, including its ID, and show the hosting group or instance creator where it's relevant (Public worlds that aren't explicitly created wouldn't show an instance creator, to avoid confusion).\n\nThis would help resolve ambiguity about what group owns the instance you're about to enter, and it would help with accidentally joining the wrong instance. It would also make room for more information about both worlds and instances.",
